Package: guvenon
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: nftables, systemd, libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1
Recommends: systemd-resolved
Maintainer: GuvenOn <tutualican@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/tutualican/guvenon
Description: DNS and local-network protection for untrusted networks
 Guven-ON applies an nftables guard that keeps DNS on trusted resolvers,
 blocks local-network exposure, and can be paused for captive portals.
 This is the Linux alpha command-line package.
